Z||000003||Seanh||05-29-2001||09:54 PM||||My car does the same thing, but never stalls. It usally catches itself before it dies. Let me know if you find the cause of your problem. Headlight relay could have been shorting out, and inflicting a huge load on the alternator and killing the enigne. Iv done this with a stereo system many times.||||reg||1
